# Benchmark result data — lives in benchmarks/results/ subfolders, not root
# These patterns prevent accidental commits of raw data to benchmarks/ root
benchmarks/logs_*.json
benchmarks/comparison_*.json
benchmarks/comparison_*.png
benchmarks/ray_*.json
benchmarks/ray_*.png

# Benchmark results are tracked under benchmarks/results/
# Uncomment below to also ignore results/ (if you prefer not to commit data)
